# Sahagin 1/3: "Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, if at least four mana was spent to cast it, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature
# and it can't be blocked this turn." Turn 3: Fractalize with X=2 (three mana, one short) and then Hill Giant (four mana, but a creature
# spell) leave it a 1/3. Turn 4: Bot2's own Fractalize with X=3 (four mana, but not Bot1's spell) leaves it alone. Turn 5: Bot1's Fractalize
# with X=3 spends exactly four: it is a 2/4 and Bot2's Grizzly Bears may not block it (Bot2 takes 2). Turn 7: with no spell cast, the
# effect is over: the Bears block it and die to its 2 power. The counter stays.

